# UI/UX Standards

## Component Design
**Atomic Design:** Atoms → Molecules → Organisms → Templates → Pages
**Reusability:** Shared components in `/shared/components/`
**Theming:** CSS custom properties for consistent styling
**Responsive:** Mobile-first approach with breakpoints

## User Experience
**Loading States:** Skeleton screens, spinners, progress bars
**Error Handling:** User-friendly error messages, retry mechanisms
**Accessibility:** WCAG 2.1 AA compliance, semantic HTML
**Performance:** Lazy loading, virtual scrolling for large lists

## Form Patterns
**Validation:** Real-time validation with clear error messages
**Input Types:** Appropriate input types for data (email, tel, date)
**Submission:** Disable submit during processing, success feedback

## Integration
**Angular Components:** Implemented using `@dev/rules/stack/frontend.md` patterns
**API Integration:** Error handling for `@dev/rules/stack/api.md` responses